  - m_Id: 70322950689058816
    m_Localized: Book Toss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70323131031547904
    m_Localized: Katrina tosses her book at Dullahan, dealing slightly reduced <color=orange><sprite="stats"
      tint=1 name=attack>physical damage</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70323151168401408
    m_Localized: "Katrina tosses her book at you\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70750879013203968
    m_Localized: Mana Resurgence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70750921295982592
    m_Localized: Katrina restores her MP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70750910311100416
    m_Localized: Katrina prays to a God to help her and THEY restore 160 MP and give
      her 2 stacks of Insanity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70752381236736000
    m_Localized: "Hastur\u2019s Challenge"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70752427567017984
    m_Localized: Passive. After reaching 35% HP, Katrina summons a Zone. While the
      Zone is up, all damage done is stored. After 5 turns, the damage stored is
      converted into Insanity stacks and given to whoever dealt less damage. All
      of the other units get cleaned of all of their Insanity stacks. Only one Zone
      can be active at the same time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71045311050608640
    m_Localized: Hastur's Blessing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71045364486041600
    m_Localized: Katrina prays for a blessing from Hastur.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71045352985260032
    m_Localized: Hastur grants a blessing for Katrina, giving her +15 POW but inflicting
      3 stacks of Insanity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71048417868050432
    m_Localized: Katrina reads something from that book.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71048356463439872
    m_Localized: Reading
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 71048406748950528
    m_Localized: Katrina starts reading the book she has in hand and gains 3 stacks
      of Insanity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
